ore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Halfly closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8842\r\n- Only doing the texture origin edit here. Y Sort Origin should IMO be handled in a separate PR. Going to do that next.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if everything changed here is necessary for this to work. Tested this on 4.7.3.rc and the master branch and works as intended. Nothing broke when I changed the values of previously `Vector2i`s while doing the edits so nothing should break even on stable branches.\r\n\r\nTested this in GUI:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2544\" height=\"1480\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/957a1562-9eb0-4f54-8ba8-0f333e60df7a\" />\r\n\r\nAlso tested with scons --test and everything passed except the networking (I'm using wsl so that may be the reason)","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-11T12:20:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T12:28:02Z","closed_at":"2026-09-11T12:26:37Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e85d83a965e4615e0659e440a74573d399999e82","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requ